'''Honnoji's Curse''' (本能寺の怨念, ''Honnōji no Onnen'', '''Honnoji's Grudge''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Freeze" Effect UP (Sm): Freeze duration is increased by 10%.

